      "judgment": "The sole hunk deletes the unreferenced panelId declaration after closePanel/detectChanges. Full-block identifier analysis finds exactly one panelId occurrence in the affected block; two declarations elsewhere in the complete original source are not removed. The property read itself is executable. Current legacy test source has no matching declaration, while production modal ownership reads remain required. Keep the historical tests and production trigger intact."
