  },
  "decision": "The complete original patch removes one unused panelId local from a modern autocomplete modal ownership test. Its initializer reads a property, so this is not classified as a type-only change or as generally free of getter effects. The complete retained legacy autocomplete spec has no corresponding panelId local or modalElement block. Its production trigger still uses panelId to maintain modal aria-owns relationships; those live reads remain unchanged. This particular private modern test cleanup has no owned statement to remove. No autocomplete accessibility or modal behavior is approved by this source exclusion.",
